    {
      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "787f06f6ae114226",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"The docket shows the petition was distributed twice before the Court called for the views of the Solicitor General (CVSG). Because a CVSG necessarily entails a supplemental distribution once the Solicitor General files their brief, expect at least one further distribution, and likely one or two additional relists thereafter as the Justices weigh the SG's recommendation. No further CVSG will be called for, as one is already on the docket.\\n\\nThe Court will likely grant plenary review",
